## Interface: 11509, 11507, 20506, 16001, 120105
## Title: OldRaidFrames
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\OldRaidFrames\icon.png
## Notes: Faithful recreation of the pre-1.15.9 Classic Era compact raid frames (Wrath-style CUF look), for raids and parties. Classic Era, TBC Anniversary, WoW Forever and Retail.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 1.1.1
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1647769
## OptionalDeps: Clique, WeakAuras
## SavedVariables: OldRaidFramesDB

# 1.15.9 API shim - must load before the libraries so aura lookups work.
Compat.lua

# Embedded heal prediction. LibHealPredict-1.0 derives incoming heals from
# native Blizzard APIs (UnitGetIncomingHeals, aura data, combat log, cast
# events) - no addon messages, no coordinator, so it works regardless of what
# the rest of the raid is running; LibStub keeps only the newest copy active
# when several addons embed it.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibHealPredict-1.0\LibHealPredict-1.0.lua

# Profile storage (AceDB-3.0) and profile sharing (AceSerializer-3.0).
# Both need LibStub + CallbackHandler-1.0 above them. ChatThrottleLib paces
# the chunked profile-send traffic in Profiles.lua (it used to arrive with
# LibHealComm-4.0, which no longer ships here).
Libs\ChatThrottleLib\ChatThrottleLib.lua
Libs\AceDB-3.0\AceDB-3.0.lua
Libs\AceSerializer-3.0\AceSerializer-3.0.lua

OldRaidFrames.lua

# Profile manager: named account-wide profiles, per-character selection,
# copy/reset/delete, export & import strings, in-game profile sending.
Profiles.lua
